{"id":"626359","name":"苦菊拌松花蛋","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/626359/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苦菊","amount":"适量"},{"name":"松花蛋","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米椒","amount":"一个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"苦菊择洗净，清水浸泡几分钟。","img":"images/626359/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"捞出控一下水。","img":"images/626359/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盘子里。","img":"images/626359/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"松花蛋去皮，切小丁（少拍了一步）。","img":"images/626359/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"松花蛋和小米椒放苦菊上面。","img":"images/626359/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，米醋，香油，芝麻酱调个料汁。","img":"images/626359/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淋上即可。","img":"images/626359/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2022/04/06/20220406164923078285441410449735.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}